Scoped field interleave/deinterleave video filter

The option table, shorthand order, plane roles, row bytes, chroma heights and
row-copy semantics in src/video-ops/il.ts follow libavfilter/vf_il.c
(il_options, query_formats, config_input, interleave, filter_frame) and the
option handling of libavfilter/avfilter.c (process_options).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
